/T (Backend behaviour is tested automatically with Jest 29 and Supertest: unit tests for pure logic \(overdue rule, JWT, role middleware, response helpers\) and integration tests that call the real Express app over HTTP against a real MongoDB database that is wiped before every test. Every automated test carries its Test ID in its name \(e.g. TC-24: ...\) and records the observed HTTP status/message, so the Actual Result columns below are generated from the run, not typed by hand. Browser behaviour \(forms, navigation, role-based screens\) is covered by the manual UI cases in section 4, which must be run and screenshotted by a group member.)
/E (Backend behaviour is tested automatically with Jest 29 and Supertest: unit tests for pure logic \(overdue rule, JWT, role middleware, response helpers\) and integration tests that call the real Express app over HTTP against a real MongoDB database that is wiped before every test. Every automated test carries its Test ID in its name \(e.g. TC-24: ...\) and records the observed HTTP status/message, so the Actual Result columns below are generated from the run, not typed by hand. Browser behaviour \(forms, navigation, role-based screens\) is covered by the manual UI cases in section 4, which must be run and screenshotted by a group member.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [51]
>>
